<title>EGYPT: SQUASH-CAIRO TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SQUASH-CAIRO TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-06-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter-final results at the Al</p>
<p>Ahram international squash tournament (prefix number denotes</p>
<p>seeding):</p>
<p>Played Sunday:</p>
<p>1-Jansher Khan (Pakistan) beat 7-Simon Parke (England) 15-11</p>
<p>15-5 5-15 15-13</p>
<p>Played Saturday:</p>
<p>5-Ahmed Barada (Egypt) beat 2-Rodney Eyles (Australia) 11-15</p>
<p>15-8 15-11 15-9</p>
<p>3-Peter Nicol (Scotland) beat 8-Del Harris (England) 15-10 15-4</p>
<p>(Harris retired)</p>
</text>
